{"text": "It was a dark autumn night, and the old banker was walking up and down his study. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was remembering a party he had given fifteen years before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Many clever people had been there, and they had talked about the death penalty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most of the guests thought that the death penalty was wrong and should be replaced by life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I disagree, said the banker, The death penalty is kinder than life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An execution kills a man at once, but life in prison kills him slowly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which is more humane, to kill you in a few minutes or to take your life away over many years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the guests was a young lawyer of about twenty five. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Both are wrong, he said, but if I had to choose, I would choose life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To live in any way is better than not to live at all.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", " ", "a", "u", "t", "u", "m", "n", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "u", "p", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "t", "u", "d", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "e", "m", "e", "m", "b", "e", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "y", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "g", "i", "v", "e", "n", " ", "f", "i", "f", "t", "e", "e", "n", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "M", "a", "n", "y", " ", "c", "l", "e"